WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:16.391
<i>Ko Chun was never surprised by anything.</i>

2
00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.272
KOH TON HOON, HAN YOUNG CHOO

3
00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:27.027
<i>Even when 20 years old</i>
<i>he was left all alone</i>

4
00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.029
<i>with a nine-year-old brother...</i>

5
00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:33.033
{\an8}AMAZING VIDEO

6
00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:39.748
<i>…he took it in stride.</i>

7
00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.211
Thank you

8
00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.965
- Eat.
- Okay.

9
00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.509
<i>He was kind to everyone.</i>

10
00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:55.180
<i>Especially to children.</i>

11
00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>But sometimes, when he was lost in his thoughts...</i>

12
00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:04.189
God

13
00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:08.985
<i>...they said that it is difficult to approach him.</i>

14
00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:11.863
Get out of here!

15
00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.908
Take it and go away.

16
00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:18.495
Nonentity. You will let me know
for me to the Ministry of Labor?

17
00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.165
Piece of shit.

18
00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:23.833
Trembling

19
00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:29.464
<i>No matter who does what,</i>
<i>he did not get angry and did not curse.</i>

20
00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:34.094
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

21
00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.011
{\an8}CHUN

22
00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:38.723
<i>Happy birthday Chun</i>

23
00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:42.560
{\an8}<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

24
00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:48.149
Did you wait to greet me?

25
00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:49.275
Yes.

26
00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.530
Thank you.

27
00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:00.203
<i>He was not happy either.</i>

28
00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:17.053
<i>Sometimes I thought,</i>
<i>did he feel anything at all.</i>

29
00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:20.306
<i>But sad movies made him cry.</i>

30
00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:25.353
Chun, are you sad?

31
00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:27.647
Yes.

32
00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:41.035
<i>This made him very different from me.</i>

33
00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:47.709
Chun, gather quickly.
We will be late for the bus.

34
00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.839
I wore this jacket a few years ago.

35
00:02:52.922 --> 00:02:54.591
Yes, but you don't wear it anymore.

36
00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.342
Listen, she's not fashionable anymore.

37
00:02:56.426 --> 00:02:58.469
And what? Quite normal.

38
00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:01.681
Come on.

39
00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:06.269
<i>He didn't want anything.</i>

40
00:03:06.811 --> 00:03:09.731
I will stay away from him.

41
00:03:11.482 --> 00:03:15.195
{\an8}You did well as the head of the family.
How did you save so much?

42
00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.906
Click on the bottom left.

43
00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:21.075
What will you do with the savings?

44
00:03:21.159 --> 00:03:24.787
Will you buy something or go somewhere?

45
00:03:25.288 --> 00:03:26.289
What would you do?

46
00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:29.751
If I were to make a list of
what I want to buy, do or where to go,

47
00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.086
it would take all day.

48
00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.340
And what would you choose? say

49
00:03:38.927 --> 00:03:41.346
This is your money. do you want something

50
00:03:42.805 --> 00:03:43.973
I don't know.

51
00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.061
<i>He didn't have any preferences.</i>

52
00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:50.521
Let's do what you want.

53
00:04:00.281 --> 00:04:04.452
<i>Sleep for 12 hours on the day off -</i>
<i>for him it was like a hobby.</i>

54
00:04:04.535 --> 00:04:08.039
I'm like: "Mr. driver, you forgot me!

55
00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:09.874
Take me!"

56
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:12.961
<i>And the rest of the day he watched movies with his brother.</i>

57
00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:14.712
So we ate corn.

58
00:04:15.713 --> 00:04:17.924
I think she likes me too.

59
00:04:18.007 --> 00:04:19.259
- Really?
- Yes!

60
00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:27.892
<i>Ko Chun has always been a good older brother…</i>

61
00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:35.275
<i>as if it was the only role in his life.</i>

62
00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:44.409
<i>He hardly had anyone,</i>
<i>who would he call a friend.</i>

63
00:04:57.547 --> 00:05:00.591
<i>And I didn't hear him talk about love.</i>

64
00:05:02.927 --> 00:05:05.430
{\an8}SEVEN CONTACTS

65
00:05:19.193 --> 00:05:21.612
Chune! can you hear me

66
00:05:21.696 --> 00:05:22.530
Chune!

67
00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:26.034
Chune, how are you?

68
00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:35.043
<i>Indeed, Ko Chun was never surprised.</i>

69
00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.966
<i>Even this time he just accepted everything.</i>

70
00:05:44.218 --> 00:05:45.219
What is it?

71
00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:49.682
Nothing, I need to go to the bathroom.

72
00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:03.196
<i>I didn't know anything about Ko Chun.</i>

73
00:06:47.698 --> 00:06:51.577
<i>Not everything is clear because of the lack of cameras.</i>

74
00:06:52.662 --> 00:06:55.498
<i>But the video recorder</i>
<i>did not detect cars nearby.</i>

75
00:06:56.207 --> 00:06:59.794
<i>No signs of brake failure</i>
<i>or other malfunctions.</i>

76
00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:06.342
{\an8}<i>We classify the accident as an accident</i>
<i>due to morning fog and rain.</i>

77
00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:11.013
{\an8}MARCH 6

78
00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:17.437
MARCH 7

79
00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:21.691
{\an8}MARCH 16

80
00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:27.947
MARCH 31

81
00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:34.495
{\an8}2 APRIL

82
00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:20.625
There is no fog.

83
00:08:27.465 --> 00:08:28.883
And the road is not slippery.

84
00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:38.684
It can't be.

85
00:08:49.445 --> 00:08:52.698
<i>Ko Chun was hiding a lot.</i>

86
00:08:56.369 --> 00:08:58.788
<i>Every morning he opened his eyes...</i>

87
00:09:00.831 --> 00:09:03.125
<i>and lived another day like this,</i>
<i>as the previous one.</i>

88
00:09:04.335 --> 00:09:05.419
<i>As if...</i>

89
00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:34.907
<i>As if he never had the desire to live.</i>

90
00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:43.749
Gomme.

91
00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:45.293
What?

92
00:09:45.793 --> 00:09:46.752
I have…

93
00:09:48.838 --> 00:09:50.548
to tell you something

94
00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.315
I guess that explains it

95
00:10:08.024 --> 00:10:12.028
my occasional falls and sleepiness.

96
00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:17.783
If I continue therapy
and I will be careful, everything will be fine.

97
00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:20.661
Doctors always say the worst.

98
00:10:22.038 --> 00:10:25.207
I missed rehab sessions,
I guess he wanted to warn me.

99
00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:27.460
Of course.

100
00:10:44.226 --> 00:10:46.062
EPISODE 7

101
00:10:46.145 --> 00:10:51.984
THANK YOU FOR THE ADVENTURE,
AND NOW IT'S TIME TO GO AHEAD

102
00:10:56.447 --> 00:10:57.782
Which one are you going to...

103
00:10:57.865 --> 00:10:59.784
Are you awake yet, mom?

104
00:11:00.534 --> 00:11:01.452
what's wrong with you

105
00:11:01.535 --> 00:11:04.664
- That is?
- You wake up early lately.

106
00:11:06.582 --> 00:11:08.000
Because I have a lot of work.

107
00:11:08.084 --> 00:11:11.420
No, you're not so happy
when busy with work.

108
00:11:12.213 --> 00:11:15.966
No need to comment on my appearance.
I'm going to work.

109
00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:18.844
- Are you dating someone?
- No.

110
00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:20.805
Learn to lie better.

111
00:11:23.933 --> 00:11:25.226
I don't date.

112
00:11:26.602 --> 00:11:28.771
Why is it so easy to lie?

113
00:11:30.189 --> 00:11:31.440
I will explain.

114
00:11:31.524 --> 00:11:34.360
always deny
that you are dating someone.

115
00:11:34.443 --> 00:11:38.864
Because if I confess, then I am waiting
a lot of questions and annoying questioning.

116
00:11:38.948 --> 00:11:42.410
I am already silent that you will wait for me
at home and I will be embarrassed.

117
00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:44.620
We both don't need it.

118
00:11:45.371 --> 00:11:49.792
I will be late at work today.

119
00:11:52.503 --> 00:11:53.671
All to mom.

120
00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.382
Smart and self-satisfied.

121
00:12:13.691 --> 00:12:15.359
Hello Ko Gyem!

122
00:12:16.152 --> 00:12:18.404
What did you think about?

123
00:12:19.947 --> 00:12:24.034
This wall is superfluous here,
if you can see through it.

124
00:12:24.118 --> 00:12:26.579
If you are going to remake it, make it lower.

125
00:12:27.246 --> 00:12:29.415
It's hard for me to stand on my tiptoes.

126
00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.922
What have you been thinking about since the morning?

127
00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.719
What is it? Did something happen?

128
00:12:43.679 --> 00:12:44.597
I'm tired

129
00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:47.016
So go to sleep, don't sit here.

130
00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:51.812
And remember that my mother lives opposite.

131
00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:56.609
By the way. I always forget to ask.

132
00:12:57.568 --> 00:12:59.904
When will you stop calling me Ko Gyeum?

133
00:13:00.529 --> 00:13:02.114
And what else to call you?

134
00:13:02.198 --> 00:13:04.825
Almost nothing has changed
since we started dating

135
00:13:04.909 --> 00:13:09.413
You keep calling me
"Aww, Ko Gyeme."

136
00:13:10.664 --> 00:13:12.750
I think this is wrong.

137
00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:15.127
- But my tone has changed.
- No.

138
00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:20.758
No. Actually,
now you look more like a bandit.

139
00:13:21.634 --> 00:13:24.053
Come up with an affectionate nickname for me.

140
00:13:24.136 --> 00:13:27.097
are you serious Nickname? Which one?

141
00:13:28.015 --> 00:13:30.184
Seriously. Think about it.

142
00:13:38.567 --> 00:13:41.320
- Neighbor?
- You are not looking for a place to live.

143
00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:43.864
Who?

144
00:13:44.573 --> 00:13:46.075
My brother is also Ko.

145
00:13:48.869 --> 00:13:50.871
- Gjom?
- It's just my name.

146
00:13:50.955 --> 00:13:52.665
Then choose yourself.

147
00:13:55.334 --> 00:13:56.502
How are you "little one"?

148
00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:57.837
Phew!

149
00:13:59.672 --> 00:14:00.673
Offensively.

150
00:14:00.756 --> 00:14:03.467
Through my corpse. Let's turn to the name.

151
00:14:03.551 --> 00:14:06.971
Then how will everyone know that we are in a relationship?

152
00:14:07.054 --> 00:14:08.389
Why should they know?

153
00:14:09.431 --> 00:14:11.851
It's still morning, and you've already upset me.

154
00:14:11.934 --> 00:14:14.019
Well, that's all. I'm going to work.

155
00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.021
Rest in peace, Ko Gyeme.

156
00:14:17.439 --> 00:14:19.775
You never go to work this early.

157
00:14:20.693 --> 00:14:25.364
Didn't you leave earlier
to walk with me?

158
00:14:28.242 --> 00:14:30.995
If you know, what are you waiting for?

159
00:14:42.756 --> 00:14:44.258
KO GYOM

160
00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:50.639
Han Sol.

161
00:14:52.391 --> 00:14:53.726
Han Sol.

162
00:14:56.896 --> 00:15:00.399
We just said goodbye.
why are you calling me

163
00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:03.652
I arrived well.

164
00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:07.406
You dropped me off near the office… You are early.

165
00:15:07.489 --> 00:15:09.992
It's strange that you ended the conversation.

166
00:15:10.075 --> 00:15:10.993
That is?

167
00:15:11.744 --> 00:15:12.661
"That is"?

168
00:15:13.662 --> 00:15:16.165
We're having a script meeting, right? come in

169
00:15:25.299 --> 00:15:28.010
Much better than the previous version.

170
00:15:28.594 --> 00:15:32.264
In the reunion scene
the tension is much more real.

171
00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:33.849
In this scene…

172
00:15:35.893 --> 00:15:37.728
What? What is it?

173
00:15:38.938 --> 00:15:39.772
Scent.

174
00:15:39.855 --> 00:15:40.898
What is the smell?

175
00:15:41.857 --> 00:15:44.944
The smell of freshly baked bread,
freshly brewed coffee

176
00:15:45.027 --> 00:15:49.031
and freshly squeezed sesame oil
no match for the smell

177
00:15:49.823 --> 00:15:51.659
new romantic relationships.

178
00:15:51.742 --> 00:15:54.870
we're not close enough
to discuss personal.

179
00:15:54.954 --> 00:15:56.538
- You are meeting someone.
- No.

180
00:15:56.622 --> 00:15:58.374
- Yes.
- No.

181
00:15:58.457 --> 00:16:00.167
- Liar.
- What's wrong with you?

182
00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.211
- I bet 100,000 won.
- I accept.

183
00:16:03.921 --> 00:16:04.838
Something wrong.

184
00:16:06.423 --> 00:16:07.549
Come what may,

185
00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:13.222
the song he is writing in this scene
the main character, will be our main topic.

186
00:16:14.098 --> 00:16:18.686
We will have to meet
with the music director and discuss the details.

187
00:16:18.769 --> 00:16:20.813
- Are you going to meet Xi Chun?
- Yes.

188
00:16:20.896 --> 00:16:21.772
Where?

189
00:16:22.648 --> 00:16:23.482
Why do you ask?

190
00:16:24.566 --> 00:16:26.485
I ask as an author...

191
00:16:27.903 --> 00:16:28.737
The smell

192
00:16:29.947 --> 00:16:31.824
I smell old feelings.

193
00:16:33.409 --> 00:16:34.576
Director Kim!

194
00:16:38.914 --> 00:16:39.915
Oh, you're awake.

195
00:16:40.416 --> 00:16:42.251
when did you come

196
00:16:42.751 --> 00:16:43.585
Long.

197
00:16:45.546 --> 00:16:47.131
You took a long nap.

198
00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:50.217
Yes, your right. I slept a little.

199
00:16:52.428 --> 00:16:53.345
Where is Golem?

200
00:16:53.846 --> 00:16:57.433
He asked me to stay here
because he went to buy groceries.

201
00:16:58.392 --> 00:17:00.728
I am like a watchdog for him.

202
00:17:00.811 --> 00:17:04.231
Why guard the house
if there is you and there is nothing to steal?

203
00:17:04.732 --> 00:17:06.483
The problem is not in the house, but in me.

204
00:17:08.277 --> 00:17:09.695
what did you read

205
00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.114
Chune

206
00:17:13.824 --> 00:17:14.825
Chune, what's wrong with you?

207
00:17:15.325 --> 00:17:16.160
Wait.

208
00:17:16.243 --> 00:17:17.786
Gradually.

209
00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.497
sit down

210
00:17:25.627 --> 00:17:28.047
I must have been lying down too long.

211
00:17:28.881 --> 00:17:30.132
Drink water first.

212
00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:35.721
Chune

213
00:17:36.472 --> 00:17:39.308
I myself was sick for a long time,
so I feel such things.

214
00:17:41.101 --> 00:17:42.686
Are you really okay?

215
00:17:46.648 --> 00:17:47.483
Everything is fine.

216
00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:51.987
You have sharply worsened
cardiopulmonary function.

217
00:17:52.071 --> 00:17:55.074
If complications arise,

218
00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:58.368
it can lead to death.

219
00:17:58.869 --> 00:18:00.704
Treatment should be started immediately...

220
00:18:02.581 --> 00:18:03.582
Everything will be fine.

221
00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:17.096
Your music will be decisive in the film.

222
00:18:17.179 --> 00:18:19.515
- So I'm looking forward to it.
- Of course.

223
00:18:19.598 --> 00:18:22.434
If you have specific thoughts or ideas,

224
00:18:22.518 --> 00:18:23.852
say without hesitation.

225
00:18:25.145 --> 00:18:27.815
See you next time in the studio.

226
00:18:29.024 --> 00:18:31.110
Agreed.

227
00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.405
Are screenwriters frequent guests of directors?

228
00:18:39.409 --> 00:18:41.662
We had a meeting, but she is not going.

229
00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:46.416
Maybe she doesn't have her own home
or maybe she is waiting for someone.

230
00:18:48.752 --> 00:18:49.837
Well, I'll go.

231
00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.879
And take her away.

232
00:18:52.214 --> 00:18:54.299
I? Pick her up?

233
00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:57.427
Why?

234
00:18:57.511 --> 00:18:59.847
Aren't you old friends?

235
00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:02.724
You already know that.

236
00:19:04.893 --> 00:19:06.645
It's all kind of strange.

237
00:19:07.646 --> 00:19:09.106
And you and Go Gyeom.

238
00:19:09.857 --> 00:19:11.233
Who told you?

239
00:19:11.316 --> 00:19:12.985
What do you think?

240
00:19:13.902 --> 00:19:16.155
Probably the whole district already knows.

241
00:19:17.781 --> 00:19:18.740
Come what may,

242
00:19:19.241 --> 00:19:23.328
you are adults and professionals
so there should be no problem, right?

243
00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:30.252
What?

244
00:19:32.212 --> 00:19:34.506
I remembered something Chu A once said.

245
00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:39.428
She said she would write a script,
will take my music and Gyom will play the part.

246
00:19:41.597 --> 00:19:45.350
So the situation is quite funny.

247
00:19:46.226 --> 00:19:48.979
Phew! Have you seen him play?

248
00:19:49.062 --> 00:19:51.732
You have an objective opinion about your boyfriend.

249
00:19:51.815 --> 00:19:53.358
I trust you, director.

250
00:19:53.442 --> 00:19:54.776
Well, see you soon.

251
00:19:56.028 --> 00:19:59.156
Just don't tell Song Choo Ah,
that Gyom is my boyfriend.

252
00:19:59.781 --> 00:20:02.034
It will only complicate everything.

253
00:20:02.534 --> 00:20:03.368
Of course.

254
00:20:04.036 --> 00:20:05.204
I didn't tell her.

255
00:20:23.639 --> 00:20:25.307
I will send you the money.

256
00:20:28.393 --> 00:20:30.479
Whose boyfriend is Golem?

257
00:20:32.147 --> 00:20:34.233
I'm dating your daughter.

258
00:20:38.445 --> 00:20:40.239
Mubi said she didn't have a boyfriend.

259
00:20:40.322 --> 00:20:43.700
We started not so long ago. Two weeks ago.

260
00:20:43.784 --> 00:20:45.786
She told me in the morning.

261
00:20:45.869 --> 00:20:47.746
- Really?
- Are you okay?

262
00:20:47.829 --> 00:20:49.998
My feelings for Mubi are sincere…

263
00:20:50.666 --> 00:20:52.668
It will not be easy to meet her.

264
00:20:53.835 --> 00:20:57.923
From the outside, she seems gentle,
but at heart she is tough.

265
00:20:58.006 --> 00:20:59.424
Don't worry.

266
00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:03.095
She is not very gentle from the outside...
That is, gentle, but...

267
00:21:03.178 --> 00:21:06.265
If you are waiting for a sweet relationship,
by the looks of it,

268
00:21:06.348 --> 00:21:07.599
you won't be around for long.

269
00:21:07.683 --> 00:21:10.477
I know that her appearance -
the only cute thing about her.

270
00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:11.728
Is he attracted to you?

271
00:21:11.812 --> 00:21:15.274
Unfortunately, I'm with her also because
that she is hard at heart.

272
00:21:15.357 --> 00:21:18.360
Apparently, people with strange tastes
sometimes converge.

273
00:21:19.152 --> 00:21:22.823
sorry, that means
that there was someone else in Muba?

274
00:21:25.117 --> 00:21:26.118
What are your disadvantages?

275
00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.246
- What?
- You are cheerful and eloquent.

276
00:21:29.329 --> 00:21:32.332
You seem like a good person
you don't lack anything.

277
00:21:33.375 --> 00:21:34.876
But everyone has disadvantages.

278
00:21:39.381 --> 00:21:41.383
Sometimes I think too much.

279
00:21:41.466 --> 00:21:42.884
This is not a minus.

280
00:21:44.469 --> 00:21:46.805
But I don't know how to get rid of these thoughts.

281
00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:54.730
take At the institution's expense.

282
00:21:56.898 --> 00:21:58.608
Your brother often bought it.

283
00:22:01.903 --> 00:22:04.072
I knew you would like me.

284
00:22:04.156 --> 00:22:05.365
This is for your brother.

285
00:22:05.449 --> 00:22:06.742
Can I call you mom?

286
00:22:06.825 --> 00:22:07.659
Phew!

287
00:22:09.453 --> 00:22:12.539
Mubi, you must have succeeded. Then excuse me.

288
00:22:17.794 --> 00:22:19.629
Good people eventually get sick.

289
00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:22.674
What?

290
00:22:22.758 --> 00:22:26.428
Share your thoughts with others.

291
00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:29.765
Try to be angry and miserable.

292
00:22:29.848 --> 00:22:31.683
This will help to get rid of thoughts.

293
00:22:32.934 --> 00:22:34.644
Someone might even help.

294
00:22:36.104 --> 00:22:36.938
Yes.

295
00:22:45.447 --> 00:22:48.158
They are so different
how do they even meet?

296
00:22:48.241 --> 00:22:51.661
Kim Mubi is not one of those
who will put up with someone like Gyom.

297
00:22:51.745 --> 00:22:52.704
Truth?

298
00:22:52.788 --> 00:22:55.374
She must be ignoring his chatter.

299
00:22:55.457 --> 00:22:57.000
How did they get together?

300
00:23:00.879 --> 00:23:04.633
And most importantly,
she is a director, and he is a film critic.

301
00:23:04.716 --> 00:23:07.886
They simply cannot coexist.

302
00:23:07.969 --> 00:23:10.222
Especially not for romantic purposes.

303
00:23:10.305 --> 00:23:14.309
This is some kind of mistake. Ko Geum and Kim Moobi?

304
00:23:14.393 --> 00:23:15.894
aren't you going

305
00:23:16.478 --> 00:23:17.813
What? Where?

306
00:23:17.896 --> 00:23:19.981
- Where do you need to go?
- Where are you going?

307
00:23:20.065 --> 00:23:21.942
- Where do I need to go?
- And you won't eat?

308
00:23:22.025 --> 00:23:23.068
with you

309
00:23:23.151 --> 00:23:25.153
Why should I wait?

310
00:23:27.656 --> 00:23:29.991
We should not eat opposite each other.

311
00:23:33.703 --> 00:23:34.704
Go through

312
00:23:35.205 --> 00:23:37.791
It is possible not to sit opposite each other.

313
00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:39.751
As you say.

314
00:23:41.503 --> 00:23:42.754
Me udon tempura.

315
00:23:42.838 --> 00:23:44.214
Udon with fried tofu.

316
00:23:54.516 --> 00:23:56.476
I thought you didn't like udon.

317
00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:58.770
You always ordered rice.

318
00:23:58.854 --> 00:24:00.105
do you remember

319
00:24:01.106 --> 00:24:02.941
I have a good memory.

320
00:24:04.818 --> 00:24:06.903
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

321
00:24:30.218 --> 00:24:33.388
You can leave when you're done. I'm not in a hurry.

322
00:24:44.691 --> 00:24:46.026
I like udon.

323
00:24:46.109 --> 00:24:47.110
Truth?

324
00:24:48.820 --> 00:24:51.239
Do you know why I ordered rice?

325
00:24:51.323 --> 00:24:54.117
I am sensitive to hot food
so they eat slowly.

326
00:24:54.201 --> 00:24:56.369
And you eat hot food very quickly.

327
00:24:57.996 --> 00:25:02.000
I only managed to eat a little,
so I started ordering rice.

328
00:25:02.667 --> 00:25:05.587
don't laugh What kind of stupid reason is that?

329
00:25:05.670 --> 00:25:07.797
You hate waiting to finish.

330
00:25:09.132 --> 00:25:11.968
I would wait if you said.
I'm not some kind of psycho.

331
00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:24.064
what else have you been doing
what made me look like a psycho?

332
00:25:31.905 --> 00:25:33.990
say I'm interested.

333
00:25:35.575 --> 00:25:36.952
I don't like Star Wars.

334
00:25:37.869 --> 00:25:40.205
I just don't like science fiction.

335
00:25:41.039 --> 00:25:42.207
It can't be.

336
00:25:42.958 --> 00:25:46.878
We have the same taste in movies.
We have watched it so many times.

337
00:25:46.962 --> 00:25:48.380
This is your favorite movie.

338
00:25:48.964 --> 00:25:50.882
Go home and watch "The Postman".

339
00:25:50.966 --> 00:25:53.927
This is my favorite movie. We have different tastes.

340
00:25:59.266 --> 00:26:00.183
And football.

341
00:26:00.267 --> 00:26:01.977
Are you not an Arsenal fan?

342
00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:04.563
I only watched football because of you.

343
00:26:05.355 --> 00:26:08.066
I don't even watch the World Cup
after our breakup.

344
00:26:10.944 --> 00:26:12.195
"Lego".

345
00:26:12.279 --> 00:26:17.284
I don't understand why people
spend so much time on it.

346
00:26:18.785 --> 00:26:20.787
We were collecting Legos for our seventh anniversary.

347
00:26:20.870 --> 00:26:22.497
And then they parted ways.

348
00:26:25.667 --> 00:26:28.169
You make me feel like a fool.

349
00:26:28.878 --> 00:26:31.339
You made me look like a fool with your silence

350
00:26:31.423 --> 00:26:33.383
and now you say it's for me?

351
00:26:33.466 --> 00:26:34.634
This is so stupid.

352
00:26:35.677 --> 00:26:36.511
What?

353
00:26:38.430 --> 00:26:40.932
I behaved stupidly.

354
00:26:43.727 --> 00:26:45.937
That's how I showed my feelings.

355
00:26:48.273 --> 00:26:51.067
I wanted to do everything your way.

356
00:26:52.861 --> 00:26:55.113
Then I loved you so much

357
00:26:55.739 --> 00:26:57.824
that she behaved pathetically, but she didn't have to.

358
00:27:02.287 --> 00:27:04.164
A strange conversation at dinner.

359
00:27:21.723 --> 00:27:24.225
How did this love disappear overnight?

360
00:27:28.938 --> 00:27:30.774
If you loved me so much...

361
00:27:33.526 --> 00:27:36.404
fragments or ashes should remain.

362
00:27:39.282 --> 00:27:41.117
Where did this feeling go?

363
00:27:44.287 --> 00:27:46.956
Many years have passed.

364
00:27:48.416 --> 00:27:50.001
All in the past

365
00:27:51.086 --> 00:27:52.462
both for you and for me.

366
00:27:54.839 --> 00:27:57.509
There is nothing left. Isn't that right?

367
00:28:29.833 --> 00:28:31.918
Do you want me to say yes or no?

368
00:28:51.062 --> 00:28:51.980
What is there?

369
00:28:52.063 --> 00:28:53.648
Chun wants to have dinner somewhere.

370
00:28:53.732 --> 00:28:56.109
What are you saying? I bought the products.

371
00:28:56.192 --> 00:28:57.986
He doesn't like to eat out.

372
00:28:58.069 --> 00:29:00.947
Did you really believe him when he said that?

373
00:29:01.030 --> 00:29:03.283
Chun must be tired of cooking.

374
00:29:03.366 --> 00:29:04.242
I cook too.

375
00:29:05.660 --> 00:29:09.748
I found a nice restaurant.
Get ready, let's go.

376
00:29:09.831 --> 00:29:13.752
Why go somewhere
if you can make soup?

377
00:29:13.835 --> 00:29:18.381
Apparently, every family has a father who
complains that he has to eat away from home.

378
00:29:18.465 --> 00:29:19.299
What?

379
00:29:19.924 --> 00:29:22.093
It's okay, dad. Never mind.

380
00:29:28.099 --> 00:29:29.434
Mubi!

381
00:29:29.517 --> 00:29:30.351
Greetings.

382
00:29:32.061 --> 00:29:34.647
Do not walk alone at night. Stick to your gang.

383
00:29:34.731 --> 00:29:35.899
I don't have a "gang".

384
00:29:35.982 --> 00:29:37.692
Yes, you have no friends.

385
00:29:38.276 --> 00:29:41.196
I had a friend
but you took him away from me.

386
00:29:41.279 --> 00:29:45.366
You don't need a friend anymore.
From now on I will be your "gang".

387
00:29:46.743 --> 00:29:49.496
Am I the only one sick of these two?

388
00:29:50.497 --> 00:29:52.916
We are going to have dinner. Come with us.

389
00:29:53.625 --> 00:29:56.795
Say no. I'm not ready yet
see you together

390
00:29:57.587 --> 00:30:00.840
You didn't have dinner, did you?
I'll let you go with my gang.

391
00:30:01.758 --> 00:30:03.593
Thank you for the invitation.

392
00:30:05.386 --> 00:30:06.471
- Let's go.
- Okay.

393
00:30:11.476 --> 00:30:13.311
- Let's go.
- There was a lot of work.

394
00:30:13.394 --> 00:30:15.814
- This is so strange, Chun.
- Okay.

395
00:30:16.523 --> 00:30:18.525
- I'm tired.
- Me too.

396
00:30:18.608 --> 00:30:19.859
Wait for us!

397
00:30:19.943 --> 00:30:21.861
- No, go.
- Well, what...

398
00:31:44.068 --> 00:31:45.570
- Gomme.
- What?

399
00:31:46.154 --> 00:31:46.988
Do not distract?

400
00:31:47.488 --> 00:31:48.907
I work, as you can see.

401
00:31:50.825 --> 00:31:52.994
- Do you want to go for a ride?
- Go for a ride?

402
00:31:53.077 --> 00:31:55.747
The weather is great.
I want to breathe fresh air.

403
00:31:56.372 --> 00:31:58.374
- Now?
- Let's go.

404
00:31:59.167 --> 00:32:00.168
Which one? This one?

405
00:32:00.835 --> 00:32:02.503
- No, this one.
- White?

406
00:32:03.671 --> 00:32:04.505
Yes.

407
00:32:04.589 --> 00:32:06.007
- When you are ready.
- Good.

408
00:32:32.033 --> 00:32:32.951
Chune!

409
00:32:34.911 --> 00:32:35.745
Class.

410
00:32:39.916 --> 00:32:41.000
Nice shot!

411
00:32:49.092 --> 00:32:51.344
Ahead.

412
00:32:55.223 --> 00:32:56.599
Is the juice tasty?

413
00:32:56.683 --> 00:32:58.601
- Yes, delicious.
- True?

414
00:32:58.685 --> 00:33:00.812
He is like an apple in the eye.

415
00:33:00.895 --> 00:33:02.772
I'm so fed up.

416
00:33:04.983 --> 00:33:06.901
When did you become a comedian?

417
00:33:35.388 --> 00:33:37.724
There is a huge willow tree

418
00:33:37.807 --> 00:33:39.809
but the nearby lake has dried up.

419
00:33:39.892 --> 00:33:42.437
Although the tree is very beautiful.

420
00:33:42.520 --> 00:33:44.272
Tell them to fill the lake.

421
00:33:44.355 --> 00:33:46.190
<i>Leave I can't.</i>

422
00:33:46.774 --> 00:33:49.527
- Can I?
- What are you! You are a director.

423
00:33:49.610 --> 00:33:52.196
"Listen everyone! I will shoot a movie here.

424
00:33:52.280 --> 00:33:54.365
Apply water and make me a lake!

425
00:33:55.199 --> 00:33:56.951
<i>And launch a couple of ducks.</i>

426
00:33:59.245 --> 00:34:02.165
It is very difficult to find the perfect place.

427
00:34:03.374 --> 00:34:04.459
<i>Indeed.</i>

428
00:34:05.126 --> 00:34:07.879
My Girl has a perfect location.

429
00:34:07.962 --> 00:34:09.881
- Shoot there.
<i>- And where is it?</i>

430
00:34:10.715 --> 00:34:12.884
I don't know. Maybe in Pennsylvania.

431
00:34:14.260 --> 00:34:18.848
By the way, the girl in the movie looks like you.

432
00:34:20.308 --> 00:34:22.143
She must be pretty.

433
00:34:22.226 --> 00:34:23.895
<i>No, not that.</i>

434
00:34:23.978 --> 00:34:26.856
she has no friends
only a sick friend.

435
00:34:26.939 --> 00:34:28.858
Do you want to be my friend too?

436
00:34:32.737 --> 00:34:34.906
I guess I should have gone with you.

437
00:34:35.823 --> 00:34:39.243
You have to watch over your brother.
Did you take him to the hospital?

438
00:34:39.869 --> 00:34:40.703
Yes.

439
00:34:42.580 --> 00:34:44.499
I'm proud of you, Ko Gyem.

440
00:34:45.208 --> 00:34:48.961
<i>It is not easy to take care of a patient,</i>
<i>even if it is a relative.</i>

441
00:34:49.045 --> 00:34:51.714
<i>But you've been doing it for years. You are a good brother.</i>

442
00:34:53.257 --> 00:34:55.843
Sometimes I hit him on the head
when he sleeps

443
00:34:57.261 --> 00:34:58.262
<i>It was so much easier.</i>

444
00:34:58.763 --> 00:35:02.433
I thought you were too good
and began to feel the distance.

445
00:35:02.517 --> 00:35:06.938
<i>No one in the world is so good.</i>
<i>When the going gets tough, let off steam.</i>

446
00:35:07.438 --> 00:35:10.608
True? Where can you find such a thing?

447
00:35:10.691 --> 00:35:13.861
To be kind requires patience.

448
00:35:13.945 --> 00:35:17.990
When you are tired and irritated,
then you can take it out on me.

449
00:35:18.074 --> 00:35:19.575
For now, I'll let you.

450
00:35:19.659 --> 00:35:20.743
"So far"?

451
00:35:20.827 --> 00:35:24.580
Yes, I'll write everything down
and then I will make you pay.

452
00:35:25.123 --> 00:35:28.000
But for now I'll be generous
so that you can give free rein to your feelings.

453
00:35:29.335 --> 00:35:31.754
It's like I'm talking to a creditor.

454
00:35:33.506 --> 00:35:35.925
Go indoors so mosquitoes don't bite.

455
00:35:36.008 --> 00:35:37.426
<i>I will be a blood donor.</i>

456
00:35:38.761 --> 00:35:40.847
<i>Okay, I'm going. Be careful.</i>

457
00:35:41.430 --> 00:35:42.265
Bye-bye

458
00:35:59.866 --> 00:36:00.700
Gomme.

459
00:36:01.450 --> 00:36:03.786
What? are you sick

460
00:36:04.871 --> 00:36:06.205
Shall we go on a trip?

461
00:36:06.289 --> 00:36:09.041
What? On a trip? So out of the blue?

462
00:36:09.125 --> 00:36:12.962
Yes, on a trip abroad. Somewhere far away.

463
00:36:13.546 --> 00:36:16.382
You can go to Europe. Or Hollywood.

464
00:36:17.216 --> 00:36:19.719
You said you always wanted to go to Hollywood.

465
00:36:19.802 --> 00:36:23.806
We can together
to go to Los Angeles, like in the movies.

466
00:36:23.890 --> 00:36:25.266
When you recover

467
00:36:25.349 --> 00:36:27.768
Why? No need to wait.

468
00:36:27.852 --> 00:36:30.897
Then no one will have free time.

469
00:36:33.316 --> 00:36:34.775
We'll go when you feel better.

470
00:36:34.859 --> 00:36:37.737
I'm perfectly fine. Look.

471
00:36:39.447 --> 00:36:40.323
Actually,

472
00:36:41.741 --> 00:36:44.869
I've already watched a few.

473
00:36:45.661 --> 00:36:48.581
Next month
there are good offers for air tickets.

474
00:36:50.041 --> 00:36:50.875
What's going on?

475
00:36:50.958 --> 00:36:53.211
What? That is?

476
00:36:53.294 --> 00:36:55.463
You've been acting strange lately.

477
00:36:59.675 --> 00:37:00.676
Truth?

478
00:37:00.760 --> 00:37:04.096
Why do you suddenly want so much?

479
00:37:04.597 --> 00:37:08.351
You invite people, you say you're bored,

480
00:37:08.434 --> 00:37:10.102
you want to go everywhere

481
00:37:11.896 --> 00:37:14.774
Before, you didn't want anything for yourself.

482
00:37:16.859 --> 00:37:20.238
why are you behaving like this
as if gathered somewhere?

483
00:37:20.780 --> 00:37:22.198
I'm nervous about it.

484
00:37:23.699 --> 00:37:27.662
I just never did
and want to try.

485
00:37:27.745 --> 00:37:29.789
i know And we will do it.

486
00:37:29.872 --> 00:37:32.708
But not all at once,
like some kind of homework.

487
00:37:32.792 --> 00:37:35.127
Let's enjoy slowly.

488
00:37:58.359 --> 00:38:01.362
Drink tea and go to bed.
You must be tired.

489
00:38:05.700 --> 00:38:06.951
Am I asking too much?

490
00:38:09.287 --> 00:38:10.204
What?

491
00:38:10.288 --> 00:38:12.957
I wanted to be prepared just in case.

492
00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:17.128
You can't…

493
00:38:19.338 --> 00:38:20.923
just support me?

494
00:38:21.507 --> 00:38:22.383
"Just in case"?

495
00:38:24.302 --> 00:38:25.303
What is the case?

496
00:38:26.137 --> 00:38:27.138
you know

497
00:38:28.347 --> 00:38:29.348
just in case.

498
00:38:35.062 --> 00:38:38.149
And what kind of case is this?

499
00:38:40.985 --> 00:38:42.153
your death

500
00:38:46.490 --> 00:38:47.992
I don't think that far ahead.

501
00:38:53.456 --> 00:38:54.957
You have to think.

502
00:38:58.961 --> 00:39:01.172
No one will prepare you for death.

503
00:39:02.256 --> 00:39:04.383
If this happens suddenly,

504
00:39:06.344 --> 00:39:08.637
those who remain have to live with it.

505
00:39:11.599 --> 00:39:14.518
Goem, don't try to avoid it...

506
00:39:18.439 --> 00:39:20.691
Did you prepare me ahead of time?

507
00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:25.613
You didn't do what you wanted to do.

508
00:39:25.696 --> 00:39:28.491
you worried
that I will suffer when you are gone.

509
00:39:31.577 --> 00:39:33.621
I'm sick of it.

510
00:39:34.914 --> 00:39:35.956
Gomme.

511
00:39:36.040 --> 00:39:37.333
listen to me

512
00:39:37.416 --> 00:39:41.962
I suffered when I tried
save your life all these years.

513
00:39:43.381 --> 00:39:46.717
And now you want
for me to help you die peacefully?

514
00:39:51.389 --> 00:39:52.223
I'm sorry

515
00:39:55.059 --> 00:39:56.769
I should have thought of your pain…

516
00:39:56.852 --> 00:39:59.271
You are even more annoying like this.

517
00:40:00.481 --> 00:40:02.400
Are you apologizing to me?

518
00:40:02.900 --> 00:40:05.319
Tell me I hurt you.

519
00:40:06.320 --> 00:40:07.988
What did I spoil for you...

520
00:40:19.875 --> 00:40:20.709
Just say it.

521
00:40:22.336 --> 00:40:25.381
A scar will remain.
Immerse your hand under cold water.

522
00:40:26.674 --> 00:40:27.508
Chune

523
00:40:29.677 --> 00:40:31.929
I didn't want to ask you.

524
00:40:39.437 --> 00:40:41.105
Have you ever wanted to die?

525
00:40:44.859 --> 00:40:46.110
What are you talking about?

526
00:40:47.027 --> 00:40:48.487
Should I ask another way?

527
00:40:55.369 --> 00:40:57.538
Have you ever wanted to live?

528
00:41:17.808 --> 00:41:18.976
I want to live

529
00:41:20.102 --> 00:41:21.854
I do it now because I want to.

530
00:41:26.650 --> 00:41:28.569
Do you even have the right to say that?

531
00:41:43.918 --> 00:41:44.752
Gomme.

532
00:41:46.587 --> 00:41:47.505
From now on

533
00:41:49.173 --> 00:41:50.591
do what you want

534
00:41:51.675 --> 00:41:53.427
Do you want to go quietly?

535
00:41:54.762 --> 00:41:55.679
Ahead.

536
00:41:56.347 --> 00:41:57.431
do you want to die

537
00:41:58.265 --> 00:41:59.099
Ahead.

538
00:42:00.017 --> 00:42:02.353
But I will try to save your life.

539
00:42:03.687 --> 00:42:04.522
Because...

540
00:42:06.941 --> 00:42:08.984
Because I can't do it without you.

541
00:42:13.531 --> 00:42:16.992
If you die, you leave me.

542
00:42:17.785 --> 00:42:20.120
You will leave me and make me an orphan again.

543
00:42:21.080 --> 00:42:23.624
Your promises to protect me
will be a lie.

544
00:42:26.252 --> 00:42:29.838
So do what you want.

545
00:43:23.809 --> 00:43:24.643
Koh Gome.

546
00:43:25.978 --> 00:43:28.480
Kim Mubi, did you have a good trip?

547
00:44:51.647 --> 00:44:53.691
Goem, did you put everything together for Chun?

548
00:44:53.774 --> 00:44:56.777
Yes, many things are not necessary,
because he will be discharged soon.

549
00:44:57.569 --> 00:45:00.489
He asked to pack the books for him.

550
00:45:00.572 --> 00:45:01.657
OK.

551
00:45:04.076 --> 00:45:05.661
Wait, that's mine.

552
00:45:05.744 --> 00:45:08.580
It? Not Chuna? I saw this notebook in his possession.

553
00:45:08.664 --> 00:45:09.957
No, it's mine.

554
00:45:10.040 --> 00:45:12.668
No wonder I couldn't find it.

555
00:45:12.751 --> 00:45:15.504
I will put things in the car.
Come out when you're ready.

556
00:45:15.587 --> 00:45:16.422
Good.

557
00:45:40.028 --> 00:45:44.575
{\an8}<i>I thought I had no will of my own.</i>

558
00:45:55.127 --> 00:45:56.795
Chune!

559
00:46:02.176 --> 00:46:03.260
Chune!

560
00:46:03.343 --> 00:46:04.178
<i>But, Goem,</i>

561
00:46:06.096 --> 00:46:09.266
<i>you called me when you cried.</i>

562
00:46:11.351 --> 00:46:15.606
<i>As if there were always just the two of us</i>
<i>against the whole world.</i>

563
00:46:16.648 --> 00:46:17.483
Gomme.

564
00:46:24.865 --> 00:46:26.450
<i>I think that's when it happened.</i>

565
00:46:28.368 --> 00:46:32.414
<i>For the first time I had my own will.</i>

566
00:46:40.380 --> 00:46:42.883
<i>And I chose you, Goem.</i>

567
00:47:01.777 --> 00:47:03.237
- Chune.
- What?

568
00:47:03.320 --> 00:47:05.239
I'll buy you a drink. What do you say?

569
00:47:06.657 --> 00:47:07.491
I am grateful

570
00:47:08.492 --> 00:47:09.660
but…

571
00:47:09.743 --> 00:47:13.080
again? You cannot live only as a brother.

572
00:47:13.747 --> 00:47:15.749
You are wasting your youth.

573
00:47:15.833 --> 00:47:18.418
I'm serious. You are too responsible.

574
00:47:27.553 --> 00:47:30.889
<i>Sometimes the responsibility was oppressive.</i>

575
00:47:57.499 --> 00:47:59.626
<i>But I never regretted it.</i>

576
00:48:19.104 --> 00:48:19.938
Chune

577
00:48:56.266 --> 00:48:57.100
Gomme.

578
00:49:36.264 --> 00:49:40.519
<i>Because you are the only one who gave me the strength to live.</i>

579
00:49:48.151 --> 00:49:51.405
Listen, look.
A cat and a mouse who can talk.

580
00:50:05.043 --> 00:50:07.004
Finished?

581
00:50:07.087 --> 00:50:09.381
Look ahead. Press the pedal.

582
00:50:09.464 --> 00:50:11.633
Look straight ahead. That's it.

583
00:50:12.884 --> 00:50:13.719
Pedals.

584
00:50:13.802 --> 00:50:16.138
Press! Spin the pedals! Go!

585
00:50:18.223 --> 00:50:20.726
You are well done! Goem, you are well done!

586
00:50:22.227 --> 00:50:24.229
<i>You often surprised me.</i>

587
00:50:26.273 --> 00:50:28.442
I'm sorry

588
00:50:30.444 --> 00:50:31.278
This is my brother.

589
00:50:32.779 --> 00:50:33.780
my brother

590
00:50:33.864 --> 00:50:34.948
Thank you.

591
00:50:42.372 --> 00:50:44.291
<i>And gave many happy moments.</i>

592
00:50:50.380 --> 00:50:52.799
- He is a weakling.
- Even I will beat him.

593
00:50:52.883 --> 00:50:53.717
Agov.

594
00:50:56.136 --> 00:50:59.139
Which one of you called Ko Gyeum
an orphaned bystyruk?

595
00:50:59.848 --> 00:51:00.849
Raise your hand.

596
00:51:01.558 --> 00:51:03.727
<i>I was often angry when you didn't know.</i>

597
00:51:10.442 --> 00:51:11.777
why are you crying

598
00:51:15.655 --> 00:51:16.656
Seriously?

599
00:51:20.619 --> 00:51:22.621
Top left.

600
00:51:22.704 --> 00:51:24.498
- Where?
- There.

601
00:51:26.458 --> 00:51:29.461
Paint carefully.

602
00:51:30.962 --> 00:51:32.297
Everything is fine.

603
00:51:32.380 --> 00:51:34.800
Eat and paint.

604
00:51:34.883 --> 00:51:38.553
<i>I liked a lot,</i>
<i>and I wanted a lot.</i>

605
00:51:45.268 --> 00:51:47.687
<i>And I had a friend with whom I got along well.</i>

606
00:51:57.864 --> 00:51:58.865
<i>Goem.</i>

607
00:51:59.866 --> 00:52:03.703
<i>Sometimes it felt like I was in water.</i>

608
00:52:04.788 --> 00:52:08.792
<i>I couldn't tell if I was sinking or swimming</i>

609
00:52:09.376 --> 00:52:10.961
<i>I was confused.</i>

610
00:52:13.296 --> 00:52:15.799
<i>And my stupid mistake...</i>

611
00:52:18.301 --> 00:52:20.720
<i>this is the only thing I wanted to hide from you.</i>

612
00:52:31.940 --> 00:52:35.902
<i>There is only one reason,</i>
<i>why do I open my eyes every morning.</i>

613
00:52:39.906 --> 00:52:40.866
<i>I really want to…</i>

614
00:52:43.243 --> 00:52:44.995
<i>to live again, Goem.</i>

615
00:53:22.365 --> 00:53:27.829
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

616
00:53:27.913 --> 00:53:29.331
He is taking pictures!

617
00:53:30.582 --> 00:53:32.334
And I want a photo with Chun.

618
00:53:32.918 --> 00:53:35.086
what are you doing There is no room here.

619
00:53:35.170 --> 00:53:36.838
- Take her away.
- Just a minute.

620
00:53:36.922 --> 00:53:38.757
- Chun, smile!
- Let's go already.

621
00:53:38.840 --> 00:53:40.508
- What are you doing?
- I want too!

622
00:53:40.592 --> 00:53:43.053
Stand closer.

623
00:53:43.136 --> 00:53:44.971
- Hug him.
- Okay.

624
00:53:45.055 --> 00:53:47.057
Yes, good.

625
00:53:47.724 --> 00:53:49.059
- On the count of three.
- Yes.

626
00:53:49.142 --> 00:53:50.644
One, two, three.

627
00:54:01.321 --> 00:54:02.239
<i>Chun…</i>

628
00:54:04.241 --> 00:54:07.244
<i>failed to keep his promise,</i>
<i>that he will be discharged soon.</i>

629
00:54:09.246 --> 00:54:10.330
<i>And I...</i>

630
00:54:12.499 --> 00:54:16.753
<i>failed to keep his promise,</i>
<i>that I will go on a journey with him.</i>

631
00:56:19.959 --> 00:56:22.670
Translation of subtitles: Natalya Kovalyshyn

